The MIT license above covers the code in this repository. It does not cover
third-party material, which keeps its own terms:

- server/data/cards.json.gz, server/data/cardtext.json: bird names and
  taxonomy from the IOC World Bird List v15.2 (CC BY 3.0); measurements from
  AVONET, Tobias et al. 2022 (CC BY 4.0); conservation status, eBird codes and
  BirdLife ids from AviList v2025 (CC BY 4.0); Wikipedia titles from Wikidata
  (CC0).
- server/data/photos.json and public/stickers/*-photo.webp: bird photos from
  Wikimedia Commons and iNaturalist under each photo's own license (CC BY,
  CC BY-SA, CC0 or public domain). Photographer, license and source page are
  listed per photo in photos.json and on public/credits.html.
- public/audio/countryside.mp3: "Countryside ambience" by Joseph Sardin,
  BigSoundBank, CC0.

See public/credits.html for full attribution.
